# Module

## Project: No Comply

**Purpose:** SolidJS component library, design system, and meta-extraction tooling for codebase introspection.

**Description:** The top-layer consumer of the Noodlestan stack. A standalone npm workspaces project providing SolidJS primitives, accessibility utilities, context management, composable components, a themeable UI library, dev tools, and meta-extraction CLI. Builds, lints, and passes CI on its own with the toolchain fully declared in its own install.

**Owner:** Project: Management

**Author:** Noodlestan Collective

**Repository:** Repository: No Comply

**Code:** https://github.com/noodlestan/no-comply

**Resources:**

- Namespace: No Comply
- Package: Solid Primitives
- Package: Solid Accessibility
- Package: Solid Contexts
- Package: Solid Composables
- Package: Standard UI
- Package: Solid Dev Tools
- Package: Meta
- Package: Meta Extract
- Package: Mybin
- Package: Standard UI Demo

